IN operator
-----------
1. IN operator is used to pick values one by one from list of values 
2. we can also use IN operator instead of OR operator when we are rtrieving multiple values from the same column  
3. In this case IN operator performance is very high compare to OR operator   
	
	syntax:
		select * from tablename
		where columnname IN(list of values);



